    "notation": "Everyone feeds on four count. Ben starts with two clubs in each hand; the others start with two in the right hand and one in the left. The eight-event sequences are: Ben Anne-self-self-self-Clare-self-self-self (straight triples); Anne self-self-Ben-self-self-self-Daniel-self (straight triple to Ben, straight single to Daniel); Clare self-self-Daniel-self-self-self-Ben-self (straight single to Daniel, straight triple to Ben); Daniel self-self-Clare-self-self-self-Anne-self (straight single passes). Self events are retained without outgoing causal edges. The graph records the source pass routes; the editor has no initial club-inventory field.",
